  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Pete has just robbed Numberland of its 10 magical number molds. Sheriff Donald Duck needs to reclaim the molds and requests help from Mickey Mouse. Playing as Mickey you are tasked with collecting at least one of a specific number mold per level you are playing. There are five different locales which are Number City, Number Factory, Space Center, Number Museum, and Pete's Hideout. After a level is completed a basic math problem must be solved for the player to continue. The game contains three difficulty levels with only the super advanced mode allowing you to take damage from enemies."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Mickey's Adventures in Numberland est un jeu de plates-formes ludo-éducatif sur Nes. Vous incarnez Mickey et devez récupérer au moins un chiffre par niveau. Le titre propose 5 environnements différents, ainsi que trois niveaux de difficulté. Le jeu est destiné à un jeune public."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Pete hat dem Numberland gerade die 10 magischen Zahlenkästen gestohlen. Sheriff Donald Duck muss die Kästen zurückholen und bittet Mickey Mouse um Hilfe. In der Rolle von Mickey musst du in jedem Level mindestens eine bestimmten Zahlenkasten einsammeln. Es gibt fünf verschiedene Schauplätze, nämlich Number City, Number Factory, Space Center, Number Museum und Pete's Hideout. Nach Abschluss eines Levels muss eine grundlegende mathematische Aufgabe gelöst werden, damit du weiterspielen kannst. Das Spiel enthält drei Schwierigkeitsstufen, wobei nur im superfortgeschrittenen Modus Schaden durch Feinde entstehen können."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Pete acaba de robar a Numberland sus 10 moldes de números mágicos. El Sheriff Donald Duck necesita recuperar los moldes y solicita ayuda de Mickey Mouse. Jugando como Mickey, tienes la tarea de recopilar al menos uno de un molde numérico específico por nivel que estás jugando. Hay cinco lugares diferentes que son Number City, Number Factory, Space Center, Number Museum y Pete's Hideout. Después de completar un nivel, se debe resolver un problema matemático básico para que el jugador continúe. El juego contiene tres niveles de dificultad con solo el modo súper avanzado que te permite recibir daño de los enemigos."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Pete ha appena derubato Numberland dei suoi 10 numeri magici. Lo sceriffo Paperino ha bisogno di recuperare gli stampi e chiede aiuto a Topolino. Giocando nei panni di Topolino, hai il compito di raccogliere almeno uno stampo numerico specifico per livello a cui stai giocando. Ci sono cinque diverse località che sono Number City, Number Factory, Space Center, Number Museum e Pete's Hideout. Dopo che un livello è stato completato, è necessario risolvere un problema di matematica di base affinché il giocatore possa continuare. Il gioco contiene tre livelli di difficoltà con solo la modalità super avanzata che ti consente di subire danni dai nemici."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Pete has just robbed Numberland of its 10 magical number molds. Sheriff Donald Duck needs to reclaim the molds and requests help from Mickey Mouse. Playing as Mickey you are tasked with collecting at least one of a specific number mold per level you are playing. There are five different locales which are Number City, Number Factory, Space Center, Number Museum, and Pete's Hideout. After a level is completed a basic math problem must be solved for the player to continue. The game contains three difficulty levels with only the super advanced mode allowing you to take damage from enemies."
    }
  ],
